<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SFX Broadcasting raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SFX Broadcasting raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it upgraded SFX Broadcasting Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one to 34-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
